{"title": "Troubadour's Wonder", "pageid": 28636, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Troubadour's_Wonder", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Troubadour's Wonder</b> is a passive feature that boosts a bard's ability to inspire.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> increases by <b>1</b>. In addition, if you have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a>, you gain 1 more use of it. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wondrous_Gloves\" title=\"Wondrous Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wondrous_Gloves\" title=\"Wondrous Gloves\">Wondrous Gloves</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Equipping an item with <b>Troubadour's Wonder</b> does not give the <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a> feature to a character who does not already have it (though it may cause a Bardic Inspiration Charges section with no actions in it to be added to the action quick bar). The AC bonus is provided to all characters, regardless of their class(es).</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Troubadour's Wonder can grant an extra Bardic Inspiration Charge once <i>per character</i> per long rest, despite the <i>Wondrous Gloves: Bardic Inspiration Depleted</i> condition on the item.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200852\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1244/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11438/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4466/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 817875/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.721      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.721      1 -total\n 32.10%   12.109      2 Template:Icon_link\n 31.09%   11.728      2 Template:Icon_text\n 29.42%   11.099     10 Template:Trim\n 26.40%    9.960      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 26.18%    9.874      1 Template:ArmourClass\n 24.95%    9.410      1 Template:WeaponProperty\n 21.34%    8.051      4 Template:Ifempty\n 20.54%    7.749      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28636-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200852 and revision id 378094. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}